      "description": "Gas CO₂ symmetric stretch, strictly IR-forbidden (Σg⁺, no dipole change) and seen only in Raman. It is carried here as the explicit parent of the νₛ+νₐₛ combination band and as the Fermi partner of the bending overtone: the cubic anharmonic term that mixes those two also mixes their +νₐₛ combination levels, which is why the pair of combination doublets higher up is marked as a Fermi pair as well.",
