          "note": "Fig. 1a and Section 3.1 (5%Ru/Al₂O₃, 320 °C, 15% CO₂/N₂): CO bound to Ru, read as linear CO on Ru⁰ alongside CO co-adsorbed with other ligands. Under H₂ it moves to 2035 cm⁻¹, which the paper reads as the Ru-CO bond of the forming formate rather than as a second species. On the DFM the same region is only a weak feature between 1990 and 2000 cm⁻¹.",
          "tags": []
        },
