          "key": "Kojima.QuantitativeAnalysisSpectral.2005",
          "technique": "srs",
          "laser_nm": 532,
          "state": "gas",
          "note": "Fig. 6 labels this line in the pure rotational H₂ spectrum, measured by spontaneous Raman in a 10 atm H₂-air flame; the paper takes the flame temperature from the intensity distribution of these lines, 1425 K in Fig. 6. The line separation across the branch is about 180 cm⁻¹. The laser line is not stated, only a pulsed Nd:YAG; 532 nm is inferred from the figure axes.",
          "tags": []
        }
      ],
      "intensity": "w",
      "width": "sharp",
